{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，S01和S05这类只有18–19秒的段落里，小字感受同时铺得较满，余光容易被分走，反而不如X只抓左侧主线省力。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y把人物线拆成短句并用放大高亮直接钉住“靠近—害怕—收住—再靠近”的关键变化，普通观众扫过去更容易连续抓住每段在发生什么、为什么会这样；按时出现的感受又能跟音乐当下对上，而不是像X右栏那样要自己猜短词对应左边哪一句。更重要的是，Y的感受常写到呼吸、失重、支撑消失、胸口发紧、声音悬住等具体变化，前后还能回扣同一组水波、摇荡、说出口/没说出口的意象，所以细腻度和整首是一件事的感觉都更强。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ae008fa7-77b6-460f-bafc-20c268b0a809", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T040844424768Z", "elapsed_seconds": 11.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:08:56.139288+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ceed99ac7dd194b2ffe0e0c505c220cab14fdf3029c7c1846a26124572b02ec9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a